OL,3,GNEWSAPart of cathedral closed after
OL,4,Aceiling damaged
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of a cathedral has been cordoned
OL,7,Foff after a piece of masonry fell from
OL,8,Fits ceiling.
OL,10,FThe south aisle of Bristol Cathedral,
OL,11,Fwhich is located in the city-centre,
OL,12,Fhas been closed to the public for
OL,13,Fsafety reasons after pieces of stone
OL,14,Fwere found on the floor.
OL,16,FUsing a cherry picker to reach the high
OL,17,Fceiling and archways, the cathedral,
OL,18,Fwhich remains open, said an assessment
OL,19,Fof the damaged ceiling is due to be
OL,20,Fcarried out over the coming weeks.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
